 "intro": "Jake Johnson (Democratic Party) is running for election to the U.S. House to represent Minnesota's 1st Congressional District. He is on the ballot in the general election on November 3, 2026. He advanced from the Democratic primary on August 11, 2026.\nJohnson completed Ballotpedia's Candidate Connection survey in 2026. Click here to read the survey answers.",
